oked the same. Stock photos, generic product copy, checkout flows that felt like obstacle courses.</p><p>We believed there was a better way — stores that felt personal, products that were genuinely useful, and buying experiences that respected the customer's time.</p><h2>What We Believe</h2><ul><li><strong>Quality over quantity</strong> — We'd rather carry fewer things done right than a catalog full of mediocrity.</li><li><strong>Transparency</strong> — If we can tell you where something comes from, how it's made, and who made it, we will.</li><li><strong>Lasting goods</strong> — Products you'll still love in five years, not five months.</li></ul><h2>Where We're Going</h2><p>We're still figuring it out, and that's the fun part. We add new products when we find ones we love. We work with small makers when we can. And we try to be honest when we get it wrong.</p><p>Thanks for being here.</p>"}}]]}]]}],null,["$","$L4",null,{"children":["$","$5",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@6"}]}]]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"J196eeRkkiIviM04UZ2mK"}
